Dear Kenyan Travel Partners=2C

We're excited to share that Mara Leisure Camp is officially reopening and=
 accepting bookings starting May 17=2C 2024. We extend our sincere appreci=
ation for your ongoing support and patience during recent challenges.

After the unfortunate floods in the Masai Mara=2C our lodge was affected.=
 However=2C we're pleased to report significant progress in repairing and=
 restoring our camp=2C ensuring an exceptional experience for our guests.

Rest assured=2C we have ample room inventory available upon reopening. We'=
ve also implemented a comprehensive repair plan to swiftly bring back our=
 full inventory.

Our hearts go out to our fellow hospitality partners and local communities=
 impacted by the floods. We empathise with their struggles and stand in so=
lidarity during this time of recovery.

We're proud to reopen our doors=2C knowing that each guest contributes to=
 the local economy and community well-being. Your support sustains the liv=
elihoods of those in the region. Marasa Africa eagerly welcomes everyone b=
ack to the Masai Mara=2C inviting you to experience the beauty of this saf=
ari season. Let's embrace resilience and rejuvenation as we explore Kenya'=
s breathtaking landscapes together.

Thank you for your continued support. Mara Leisure Camp looks forward to h=
osting you again.
